{"4733950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Exiled Ark", "steam_appid": 4733950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4892360, 4916960], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exiled Ark</strong> is a top-down sci-fi survival shooter set aboard humanity's last surviving colony starship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After centuries adrift in deep space, the Ark has become a shattered world of ruined habitats, abandoned facilities, hostile creatures, and forgotten technologies. As one of the last survivors, you must explore the wreckage, gather resources, build strongholds, craft powerful weapons, and restore critical ship systems to secure humanity's future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras/866093e3cd4dacbb1ee63a980eae1d0f.poster.avif?t=1785423676\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras/866093e3cd4dacbb1ee63a980eae1d0f.webm?t=1785423676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras/866093e3cd4dacbb1ee63a980eae1d0f.mp4?t=1785423676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, Build, Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge resources across vast derelict sectors, from abandoned residential rings and industrial facilities to dangerous alien-infested zones. Establish and relocate outposts wherever you choose, creating a network of bases to support your survival and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras/503777f86c63c219780164468ce214cb.poster.avif?t=1785423676\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras/503777f86c63c219780164468ce214cb.webm?t=1785423676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras/503777f86c63c219780164468ce214cb.mp4?t=1785423676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelite Combat and Character Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle swarms of hostile creatures and powerful bosses using a wide arsenal of firearms, melee weapons, drones, and advanced technologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your character through six core attributes and discover dozens of unique traits, including <strong>Terminator</strong>, <strong>Psionic Aptitude</strong>, <strong>Force Awakening</strong>, and more. Experiment with different combinations to create powerful and unique builds every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras/e302fbd688c8fecba2883f3e70b92d4b.avif?t=1785423676\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras_big/e302fbd688c8fecba2883f3e70b92d4b.avif?t=1785423676 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Humanity's Future</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research four specialized technology trees:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Material Science</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interstellar Navigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanical Ascension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neo-Human Genetics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock advanced technologies ranging from exoskeletons and nanomachines to genetic enhancement and psionic abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras/66326345046581f42a4b2e125849196d.poster.avif?t=1785423676\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras/66326345046581f42a4b2e125849196d.webm?t=1785423676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras/66326345046581f42a4b2e125849196d.mp4?t=1785423676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit robotic companions and mutated allies, uncover hidden signals from across the stars, and investigate the mysteries surrounding the Ark's artificial intelligence.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exiled Ark</strong> is a top-down sci-fi survival shooter set aboard humanity's last surviving colony starship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After centuries adrift in deep space, the Ark has become a shattered world of ruined habitats, abandoned facilities, hostile creatures, and forgotten technologies. As one of the last survivors, you must explore the wreckage, gather resources, build strongholds, craft powerful weapons, and restore critical ship systems to secure humanity's future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras/866093e3cd4dacbb1ee63a980eae1d0f.poster.avif?t=1785423676\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras/866093e3cd4dacbb1ee63a980eae1d0f.webm?t=1785423676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras/866093e3cd4dacbb1ee63a980eae1d0f.mp4?t=1785423676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, Build, Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge resources across vast derelict sectors, from abandoned residential rings and industrial facilities to dangerous alien-infested zones. Establish and relocate outposts wherever you choose, creating a network of bases to support your survival and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras/503777f86c63c219780164468ce214cb.poster.avif?t=1785423676\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras/503777f86c63c219780164468ce214cb.webm?t=1785423676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras/503777f86c63c219780164468ce214cb.mp4?t=1785423676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelite Combat and Character Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle swarms of hostile creatures and powerful bosses using a wide arsenal of firearms, melee weapons, drones, and advanced technologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your character through six core attributes and discover dozens of unique traits, including <strong>Terminator</strong>, <strong>Psionic Aptitude</strong>, <strong>Force Awakening</strong>, and more. Experiment with different combinations to create powerful and unique builds every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras/e302fbd688c8fecba2883f3e70b92d4b.avif?t=1785423676\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras_big/e302fbd688c8fecba2883f3e70b92d4b.avif?t=1785423676 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Humanity's Future</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research four specialized technology trees:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Material Science</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interstellar Navigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanical Ascension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neo-Human Genetics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock advanced technologies ranging from exoskeletons and nanomachines to genetic enhancement and psionic abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras/66326345046581f42a4b2e125849196d.poster.avif?t=1785423676\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras/66326345046581f42a4b2e125849196d.webm?t=1785423676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/extras/66326345046581f42a4b2e125849196d.mp4?t=1785423676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit robotic companions and mutated allies, uncover hidden signals from across the stars, and investigate the mysteries surrounding the Ark's artificial intelligence.</p>", "short_description": "Fight, build, and survive aboard a ruined interstellar colony ship. Scavenge resources, forge powerful weapons, establish strongholds, and reclaim humanity's last Ark. Master six attribute paths, unlock four technology trees, and shape your own ending through roguelike and relentless combat.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/31bedb542108d8b37db280cc65e13d7861827bee/header.jpg?t=1785423676", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733950/6eb9263c7343ead03df6b7b689515e1c04928d70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785